1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,528
This tiny animal survived 10 days in open space.

2
00:00:04,105 --> 00:00:07,062
It's a tardigrade, barely half a millimeter long.

3
00:00:07,607 --> 00:00:11,449
To survive, it dries itself out, losing almost all its water,

4
00:00:11,811 --> 00:00:14,112
And comes back to life when it gets wet again.

5
00:00:14,609 --> 00:00:16,728
After the trip, some even had babies.

6
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:18,871
But here's the crazy part.

7
00:00:19,323 --> 00:00:22,957
In 2019, thousands of them crash-landed on the moon.

8
00:00:23,434 --> 00:00:24,849
And they might still be up there.
